    `I am an apprentice under a contract and a registered training contract` IS FALSE
    `I contracted to do the work myself` IS TRUE
    `the work is part of a trade or business I regularly carry on in my own or a business name` IS FALSE
    `I sublet the contract` IS FALSE
    `I employ a worker` IS TRUE
    `I do part of the work personally` IS FALSE

`Jake's employment with Sentinel, October 2053` MEANS `My engagement` WITH
